// INCLUDE "lib/hold_seed.cubalc"  (from a programs/* path) or absolute path
//
// HOLD_FLASH is a **device/firmware connection safeguard**, not a program
// preamble. Runtime already defaults hold_flash=1 for normal cube PLUG.
//
// Use this seed only when you need an explicit sticky ack for hosts that
// can change firmware / physical devices. Ordinary agent programs should
// NOT require this INCLUDE.
//
//   HOLD_FLASH 1  — allow device plug (default at runtime anyway)
//   HOLD_FLASH 0  — deny PLUG (tests / lock-down)

HOLD_FLASH 1
BUDGET 40
SHARE state_matrix_only
